Calendar data provenance
------------------------

The module :calendar-chinese-native uses a month table generated at development time by
tools/chinese-calendar/generate.py from published astronomical algorithms: VSOP87D Earth
series (Bretagnon & Francou 1988), Meeus, Astronomical Algorithms, 2nd ed., chapters 25 and 49,
and the Espenak & Meeus Delta T expressions. The VSOP87D input file is not redistributed and no
Hong Kong Observatory conversion table, ICU data or third-party calendar code is embedded.
Reference comparisons and the three documented deviations (each audited with JDE, Delta T, UTC,
UTC+8 and an independent NASA/GSFC new-moon time) are recorded in
tools/chinese-calendar/manifest.json and tools/chinese-calendar/reference-conflicts.json. The
generator and its output are covered by the project's Apache-2.0 license; the cited algorithms
and reference data remain subject to their own terms.
